    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirius-4 is a space simulator that gives the player complete freedom of action. The game takes place in a galaxy created using a level generator, which makes each new game session unique. There are various independent groups operating in these open spaces: pirates, fanatics and supranational interstellar corporations. The player is given a unique opportunity to explore this vast and vibrant world. Every time going into space, the player will be able to feel the pulse of humanity: hear the routine radio conversations of pilots and encounter ships tracking their routes. All this creates a unique atmosphere of a free pilot's life. All this is Sirius-4.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirius-4 is a space simulator that gives the player complete freedom of action. The game takes place in a galaxy created using a level generator, which makes each new game session unique. There are various independent groups operating in these open spaces: pirates, fanatics and supranational interstellar corporations. The player is given a unique opportunity to explore this vast and vibrant world. Every time going into space, the player will be able to feel the pulse of humanity: hear the routine radio conversations of pilots and encounter ships tracking their routes. All this creates a unique atmosphere of a free pilot's life. All this is Sirius-4.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Sirius-4&quot; is a plot-oriented space simulator that gives the player complete freedom of action as a hired pilot of the &quot;Sirius&quot; unit. The action takes place on the outskirts of human space during a turbulent time for the galaxy after a global war.",
